        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "At the end of its life-span, Melmetal will rust and fall apart. The small shards left behind will eventually be reborn as Meltan.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "寿命が　尽きると　体が 錆びて　崩れる。　やがて　小さな 破片が　メルタンに　復活する。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On dit que, grâce à la force centrifuge, les coups de poing qu’il assène avec ses lourds écrous seraient les plus dévastateurs parmi les Pokémon.",
